WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.280
The storm is getting worse.

2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.390
I can't give up now.

3
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.260
The light has to keep burning.

4
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:13.050
Then let's climb up and check the lamp.

5
00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:16.940
Hold on tight. We're almost there.

6
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.220
Look! The ship has seen the light.
